        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &lt;<strong>Dirty Laundry&gt;</strong> – a quirky little desktop game all about <strong>socks, cleaning, and the most outrageous collections</strong> you can imagine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, your <strong>only tool is your mouse</strong>.<br>Simply <strong>move it around</strong>, and you’ll start pulling socks out of a mysterious <i>“Sock Dimension”</i>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ordinary sports socks</strong>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute, stylish stockings</strong>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ridiculous shoe-socks</strong>...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And even <strong>strange, bizarre things</strong> that… well, <strong>aren’t even socks at all</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toss everything you collect into your <strong>washing machine</strong> and clean them up!<br>Freshly washed socks turn into <strong>gold coins</strong>, which you can use to <strong>upgrade your washing machine</strong> —<br>transforming it from a <strong>beat-up old clunker</strong> into a <strong>high-tech, futuristic sock-cleaning beast</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your washing machine <strong>evolves</strong>, the socks you find will get <strong>wilder, crazier, and more ridiculous</strong>.<br>Before long, you might start to <strong>question what truly counts as a sock</strong>…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re a <strong>collector at heart</strong>, an <strong>upgrade addict</strong>,<br>or just someone who loves watching socks fly all over the screen,<br><strong>Dirty Laundry</strong> will give you a <strong>relaxing yet addictive sock-filled adventure</strong> —<br>all with just a simple flick of your mouse!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &lt;<strong>Dirty Laundry&gt;</strong> – a quirky little desktop game all about <strong>socks, cleaning, and the most outrageous collections</strong> you can imagine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, your <strong>only tool is your mouse</strong>.<br>Simply <strong>move it around</strong>, and you’ll start pulling socks out of a mysterious <i>“Sock Dimension”</i>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ordinary sports socks</strong>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute, stylish stockings</strong>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ridiculous shoe-socks</strong>...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And even <strong>strange, bizarre things</strong> that… well, <strong>aren’t even socks at all</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toss everything you collect into your <strong>washing machine</strong> and clean them up!<br>Freshly washed socks turn into <strong>gold coins</strong>, which you can use to <strong>upgrade your washing machine</strong> —<br>transforming it from a <strong>beat-up old clunker</strong> into a <strong>high-tech, futuristic sock-cleaning beast</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your washing machine <strong>evolves</strong>, the socks you find will get <strong>wilder, crazier, and more ridiculous</strong>.<br>Before long, you might start to <strong>question what truly counts as a sock</strong>…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re a <strong>collector at heart</strong>, an <strong>upgrade addict</strong>,<br>or just someone who loves watching socks fly all over the screen,<br><strong>Dirty Laundry</strong> will give you a <strong>relaxing yet addictive sock-filled adventure</strong> —<br>all with just a simple flick of your mouse!</p>",
        "short_description": "Welcome to Dirty Laundry – a quirky little desktop game all about socks, cleaning, and collecting the most bizarre stuff imaginable! Here, you’ll find all kinds of socks…or not? Toss everything you collect into the washing machine and clean them up — save your desk from the ultimate sock invasion!!!",
